WEBVTT

00:00:03.830 --> 00:00:11.860
According to the men who just came 
back, the giant god is drawing near.

00:00:11.860 --> 00:00:15.790
There is a race of monsters called giants, but...

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:23.950
W-We should probably run...

00:00:23.950 --> 00:00:25.400
But where?

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:27.170
S-Some of us can't fly...

00:00:27.170 --> 00:00:29.520
Is the giant god really coming here?

00:00:29.520 --> 00:00:31.010
Did we do something to upset them?

00:00:30.670 --> 00:00:31.990
It's a curse!

00:00:31.990 --> 00:00:34.880
E-Everyone... F-First...

00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:35.930
Hear me now!

00:00:38.390 --> 00:00:40.670
The village is in a state of emergency.

00:00:40.670 --> 00:00:43.400
You must all remain calm.

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:45.090
First, Illy.

00:00:45.090 --> 00:00:46.390
Wh-What?

00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:50.560
Go to Lindworm and inform 
Lady Skadi of what is transpiring here.

00:00:50.560 --> 00:00:52.900
You're the perfect candidate 
because she knows you.

00:00:52.900 --> 00:00:54.870
Sure, leave it to me!

00:00:54.870 --> 00:00:58.330
Those of you who can fly, 
prepare to head to Lindworm shortly.

00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:01.740
Kay and Lorna, prepare the carriage.

00:01:01.740 --> 00:01:03.280
As you wish, my lady.

00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:05.710
You there, spider woman.

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:09.240
Do you plan on helping?

00:01:09.770 --> 00:01:12.960
Well, I'll do what I can.

00:01:14.250 --> 00:01:15.650
Thank you kindly.

00:01:15.650 --> 00:01:19.940
In that case, please use your silk to package 
everyone's belongings as compactly as possible.

00:01:19.940 --> 00:01:21.770
Miss Tisalia is amazing.

00:01:21.770 --> 00:01:23.800
She's being very precise with her orders.

00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:25.760
As for you, Good Doctor.

00:01:25.760 --> 00:01:26.850
Y-Yes?

00:01:27.180 --> 00:01:29.800
Please take care of the harpies 
who are unable to fly.

00:01:29.800 --> 00:01:32.570
The carriage can only carry so many.

00:01:32.570 --> 00:01:35.600
I need some of them to descend this 
mountain on their own if they can.

00:01:36.080 --> 00:01:37.190
All right.

00:01:38.640 --> 00:01:40.450
Let's move, everyone!

00:01:59.200 --> 00:02:03.240
<b>Monster Girl Doctor</b>

00:03:22.220 --> 00:03:25.720
Case 8        Attack on Gigas

00:03:34.920 --> 00:03:36.650
There, you're all set now.

00:03:37.050 --> 00:03:38.840
This will keep your wing safe.

00:03:38.840 --> 00:03:40.280
You still won't be able to fly,

00:03:40.540 --> 00:03:43.570
but you should be able to 
walk down the mountain just fine.

00:03:43.570 --> 00:03:45.400
Thank you very much.

00:03:47.240 --> 00:03:48.920
Dr. Glenn.

00:03:48.920 --> 00:03:51.280
That was the last patient.

00:03:51.280 --> 00:03:53.530
We should start gathering 
our belongings, as well.

00:04:02.710 --> 00:04:06.040
It looks like Miss Arahnia's helping, too.

00:04:06.390 --> 00:04:08.640
She's really not so bad.

00:04:20.710 --> 00:04:23.820
We'll be doomed if we have 
to deal with a giant god.

00:04:23.820 --> 00:04:25.120
Let's leave immediately.

00:04:41.240 --> 00:04:43.330
Everyone's begun evacuating already.

00:04:45.110 --> 00:04:46.730
Is something the matter?

00:04:47.590 --> 00:04:51.930
Say, did you see Miss Tisalia on our way here?

00:04:51.930 --> 00:04:55.650
No. Come to think of it, 
she's not here, either.

00:05:01.250 --> 00:05:03.400
I don't want to even imagine it, but...

00:05:11.100 --> 00:05:14.830
Perhaps I should've at least told 
the good doctor about this...

00:05:14.830 --> 00:05:18.250
But if I had, I'm sure he 
would've tried to stop me.

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:22.550
After all, trying to stall a 
giant god by fighting is just...

00:05:24.370 --> 00:05:27.760
It will take far too long 
for everyone to escape.

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:31.210
Someone must act as a shield 
while the rest try to get away.

00:05:32.370 --> 00:05:36.810
In that case, the only one suitable 
to take up the lance is myself.

00:05:37.210 --> 00:05:40.170
Even if I'm no match for them...

00:05:47.390 --> 00:05:53.400
I know. Should I happen to survive, 
I'll propose to the good doctor.

00:05:56.320 --> 00:05:58.740
Could you give that creepy laughter a rest?

00:05:58.740 --> 00:05:59.330
Huh?

00:06:05.920 --> 00:06:06.710
M...

00:06:07.310 --> 00:06:09.010
Miss Sapphee?

00:06:09.010 --> 00:06:10.430
What are you doing here?

00:06:12.810 --> 00:06:15.110
What is that fluffy thing you're wearing?

00:06:15.110 --> 00:06:17.320
I'm freezing.

00:06:17.320 --> 00:06:20.030
I had Arahnia make this for me on the spot.

00:06:20.510 --> 00:06:22.100
More importantly...

00:06:22.370 --> 00:06:25.310
Are you planning to face the giant god alone?

00:06:26.130 --> 00:06:30.200
But of course! That is my job as 
someone who stands at the top.

00:06:31.060 --> 00:06:33.190
Your ears are trembling.

00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:39.450
The body does not lie. 
It's obvious that you're scared.

00:06:39.450 --> 00:06:42.010
I've already made up my mind!

00:06:42.010 --> 00:06:44.080
I'm not surprised to hear that from you.

00:06:48.570 --> 00:06:51.860
But if you're determined 
to risk your life fighting,

00:06:52.710 --> 00:06:54.640
as your doctor, I can't just stand idly by.

00:06:55.030 --> 00:06:57.460
N-Not you, too, Good Doctor...

00:06:58.270 --> 00:07:02.490
This is exactly why I didn't 
tell anyone I was coming here.

00:07:02.490 --> 00:07:04.890
But you cannot stop me.

00:07:05.510 --> 00:07:08.250
Someone must stall the giant god.

00:07:08.250 --> 00:07:10.420
Then I shall help you.

00:07:10.420 --> 00:07:14.130
H-Help me? You didn't come here to stop me?

00:07:14.130 --> 00:07:17.840
It's not like our little horsey 
would listen anyway if we did.

00:07:17.840 --> 00:07:21.700
We might die. That's why 
I'm better off going alone.

00:07:21.700 --> 00:07:25.770
And what if you're not able to stall 
them and we get trampled anyway?

00:07:25.770 --> 00:07:29.010
And that's why you want to 
tag along? How amusing.

00:07:29.010 --> 00:07:32.770
I need you to get the good doctor 
down this mountain safely.

00:07:32.770 --> 00:07:34.350
Calm down, you two.

00:07:34.770 --> 00:07:36.990
I've got an idea.

00:07:42.490 --> 00:07:44.650
A-Are you certain about this?

00:07:44.650 --> 00:07:46.470
Yes, I am.

00:07:46.780 --> 00:07:50.140
I'm going to dissuade the giant 
god from coming to the village.

00:07:51.520 --> 00:07:56.140
It's not like the doctor to run 
away in situations like these.

00:07:56.140 --> 00:07:58.620
I promise you he's much 
more stubborn than us.

00:07:58.620 --> 00:08:00.330
B-But...

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:03.320
None of us plan on running away.

00:08:03.320 --> 00:08:07.430
In that case, we're probably better 
off facing the giant god together.

00:08:09.890 --> 00:08:12.310
What do you say, Tisalia?

00:08:13.700 --> 00:08:16.550
All right, Sapphee.

00:08:17.080 --> 00:08:20.000
The good doctor is someone I've acknowledged.

00:08:20.000 --> 00:08:22.640
If you insist, I will follow.

00:08:23.300 --> 00:08:24.180
But...

00:08:24.730 --> 00:08:27.220
If our talks break down...

00:08:27.700 --> 00:08:30.840
Yes. We'll handle it then.

00:08:30.840 --> 00:08:35.190
I'm sure this poison will have at least 
some effect, even on a giant god.

00:08:35.190 --> 00:08:39.730
Then you will weaken them with the 
poison, and that is when I'll strike.

00:08:39.730 --> 00:08:40.940
Does that work for you?

00:08:40.940 --> 00:08:42.430
That sounds reasonable.

00:08:44.990 --> 00:08:46.340
They're close.

00:08:47.870 --> 00:08:50.310
Let's go, you two.

00:09:04.080 --> 00:09:05.950
Are you all right, Sapphee?

00:09:38.910 --> 00:09:40.020
D-Doctor!

00:09:41.170 --> 00:09:44.310
Lady Goddess, I'd like to speak with you.

00:09:47.800 --> 00:09:52.480
The villagers are terrified by 
you coming down the mountain.

00:09:52.480 --> 00:09:56.730
If something has angered you, please tell us!

00:10:10.530 --> 00:10:11.450
Good Doctor!

00:10:25.160 --> 00:10:27.020
Pardon me...

00:10:27.410 --> 00:10:31.510
I heard that there was a 
doctor in the village...

00:10:31.510 --> 00:10:37.210
I was hoping they could examine me.

00:10:44.940 --> 00:10:46.480
Examine you?

00:10:47.550 --> 00:10:49.490
A giant god's coming?

00:10:49.790 --> 00:10:53.260
They're just things from fairy tales. 
Did you have some kind of nightmare?

00:10:53.260 --> 00:10:54.900
No!

00:10:54.900 --> 00:10:57.380
The giant god is right by our village!

00:10:57.810 --> 00:10:59.510
There's no need to worry.

00:11:02.190 --> 00:11:06.130
The giant god that lives in the 
Vivre Mountains won't harm anyone.

00:11:07.170 --> 00:11:11.070
Her name is Dione Nephilim.

00:11:09.620 --> 00:11:11.960
<b>Monster Girl Doctor</b>

00:11:22.650 --> 00:11:25.450
So this is an exam?

00:11:33.980 --> 00:11:36.600
Next, could you stick your tongue out for me?

00:11:40.720 --> 00:11:42.050
Whoa...

00:11:44.420 --> 00:11:47.930
D-Doctor! Please be careful!

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:50.670
You're already working on very little sleep!

00:11:51.100 --> 00:11:52.740
I'm fine!

00:11:53.330 --> 00:11:55.910
I'm sowwy...

00:11:55.910 --> 00:11:58.850
It's all right. Let's continue the exam.

00:12:03.540 --> 00:12:05.450
You can go ahead and close it.

00:12:07.360 --> 00:12:10.710
You have a cold. 
You also appear to have a fever.

00:12:11.070 --> 00:12:13.720
When did you start feeling sick?

00:12:14.570 --> 00:12:18.510
Let's see... Maybe ten years ago?

00:12:19.550 --> 00:12:23.430
So right around when Lindworm 
became the city it is now.

00:12:23.840 --> 00:12:28.440
Yes. That's right around the time 
Little Skadi came to see me.

00:12:28.440 --> 00:12:29.950
Lady Skadi did?

00:12:30.930 --> 00:12:36.160
Yes. Back then, I thought I might 
just get better after some rest.

00:12:36.160 --> 00:12:37.950
But it just...

00:12:39.070 --> 00:12:41.460
All right. I'll prepare some medication for you.

00:12:44.400 --> 00:12:46.610
Dr. Glenn!

00:12:54.750 --> 00:12:57.170
Th-Thanks...

00:12:57.170 --> 00:13:00.510
No worries. I'm glad I could help.

00:13:02.590 --> 00:13:05.910
<i>I guess their breasts are soft, 
just like a human's.</i>

00:13:07.280 --> 00:13:09.850
Th-This...

00:13:09.850 --> 00:13:13.670
might prove difficult... to climb out...

00:13:25.630 --> 00:13:27.110
Oh?

00:13:30.660 --> 00:13:32.760
I-I'm going to die...

00:13:39.950 --> 00:13:42.960
Lady Goddess, where the heck 
do you usually hang out?

00:13:43.700 --> 00:13:46.290
At the summit.

00:13:46.290 --> 00:13:49.750
It must've taken you a while 
to get to the village.

00:13:49.750 --> 00:13:53.260
You scared us. We thought we 
were having an earthquake.

00:13:53.260 --> 00:13:55.110
I'm so sorry.

00:13:55.590 --> 00:14:00.590
I was trying to be really careful not to 
squish any of the animals in the forest,

00:14:01.050 --> 00:14:03.700
so I took my time getting here.

00:14:03.700 --> 00:14:06.750
Aw... Must be rough not being able to fly.

00:14:07.840 --> 00:14:12.230
We just gave her normal cold medicine 
made from an infusion of herbal extracts.

00:14:12.230 --> 00:14:14.540
Do you think it will work on her?

00:14:14.540 --> 00:14:16.150
It should.

00:14:16.150 --> 00:14:21.430
She may be bigger in size, but she 
should still be a giant monster.

00:14:21.430 --> 00:14:24.380
I do apologize for all the fuss.

00:14:24.790 --> 00:14:29.750
Heavens, I had no idea the 
Lady Goddess was so kind.

00:14:29.750 --> 00:14:34.260
Was the legend about the goddess 
attacking the village a mistake, then?

00:14:34.640 --> 00:14:39.810
Yes. Apparently, she was just trying to 
approach the village, just like this time.

00:14:39.810 --> 00:14:44.170
I'm not certain where the tales went wrong.

00:14:44.700 --> 00:14:48.020
But just in case, we should probably 
make sure she doesn't get a cold again,

00:14:48.020 --> 00:14:51.220
so that she doesn't try to 
come to the village again.

00:14:51.650 --> 00:14:55.040
If we can get her heavier 
clothes so she can stay warm...

00:14:56.480 --> 00:14:58.490
I know just who to ask for that!

00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:02.000
I get to make clothes for a giant goddess?

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:05.630
That's like a fashion designer's dream!

00:15:05.630 --> 00:15:12.010
But with these materials... I'll only 
be able to make a hat and an apron.

00:15:17.850 --> 00:15:19.560
Please use this.

00:15:19.560 --> 00:15:21.280
Please use this for the goddess, as well.

00:15:21.280 --> 00:15:24.570
Oh, with this, I'll be able 
to make some shoes, too!

00:15:24.570 --> 00:15:27.280
Thank you! I'm itching to get started!

00:15:27.660 --> 00:15:29.590
We're counting on you.

00:15:29.590 --> 00:15:30.760
You got it!

00:15:35.400 --> 00:15:37.270
Meanwhile, we'll tend to...

00:15:37.270 --> 00:15:39.160
...the Lady Goddess's hair.

00:15:47.790 --> 00:15:53.580
I've caused you so much trouble, 
but you did all this for me...

00:15:53.580 --> 00:15:57.590
Please make sure you recuperate in the 
village until you feel completely better.

00:15:59.900 --> 00:16:03.090
Now that that's all settled, 
we can finally head home.

00:16:03.850 --> 00:16:06.610
We really need to open the clinic soon.

00:16:06.610 --> 00:16:11.560
Yeah. A lot happened, but I'm 
glad everything worked out okay.

00:16:29.810 --> 00:16:30.590
Doctor!

00:16:31.370 --> 00:16:32.590
Illy.

00:16:32.940 --> 00:16:35.110
I've got a letter for you 
from the Central Council.

00:16:35.110 --> 00:16:37.110
A letter? Why are you bringing it to me?

00:16:38.370 --> 00:16:39.350
Well, you see...

00:16:40.600 --> 00:16:43.850
So I heard that Illy's working 
at Scythia Transportation.

00:16:44.330 --> 00:16:49.110
She came to deliver me an invitation to the 
Merrow Waterways commemoration ceremony.

00:16:49.850 --> 00:16:54.960
Indeed. I'm having her work as 
one of my messengers in the sky.

00:16:54.960 --> 00:16:58.750
That might be perfect for Illy, 
since she loves to fly.

00:16:58.750 --> 00:17:03.270
Yes! It's so nice to see how 
much she's calmed down.

00:17:04.050 --> 00:17:08.520
Since I invited you out tonight, dinner's 
on me. Please eat as much as you'd like.

00:17:08.520 --> 00:17:10.390
Oh, are you sure?

00:17:10.390 --> 00:17:14.860
Yes. We caused you a lot of trouble 
while we were in the harpies' village,

00:17:14.860 --> 00:17:16.770
and you helped take care of Illy.

00:17:17.340 --> 00:17:20.270
Oh, it was no trouble at all.

00:17:20.270 --> 00:17:23.130
There was also that little 
incident with Miss Arahnia.

00:17:23.130 --> 00:17:25.270
<i>She</i> was definitely trouble.

00:17:26.490 --> 00:17:29.760
Also, when we heard the giant goddess 
was coming and panic broke out,

00:17:30.820 --> 00:17:34.700
you were ready to take her on with 
just your lance. That surprised me.

00:17:35.990 --> 00:17:38.120
You have to have strong resolve to—

00:17:38.120 --> 00:17:39.780
Yes, exactly!

00:17:39.780 --> 00:17:42.900
I was ready to risk my life out there!

00:17:46.110 --> 00:17:47.310
Pardon me...

00:17:47.820 --> 00:17:50.040
But it's true that I...

00:17:50.590 --> 00:17:53.780
I was prepared to die when I 
went to face the giant goddess.

00:17:53.780 --> 00:17:55.030
And yet...

00:17:55.030 --> 00:17:58.170
She only had a cold and 
wanted you to examine her!

00:17:58.550 --> 00:18:01.110
Well, at least everything turned out okay.

00:18:01.110 --> 00:18:03.800
Yes, of course! Absolutely!

00:18:03.800 --> 00:18:04.840
But still...

00:18:04.840 --> 00:18:08.900
You must be quite embarrassed now,
after all your posturing before, Tisalia.

00:18:08.900 --> 00:18:11.640
And you! Stop hitting the 
nail right on the head!

00:18:11.640 --> 00:18:16.540
I allowed you to look in on our date, 
but I never said you could interrupt!

00:18:16.540 --> 00:18:18.670
Whatsoever do you mean by "date"?

00:18:18.670 --> 00:18:24.000
It's exactly what it sounds like! 
The good doctor personally invited me out!

00:18:24.000 --> 00:18:26.400
I'm pretty sure I never said 
anything about a date...

00:18:27.720 --> 00:18:31.430
Tisalia, it may not sound like it, 
but I'm praising you.

00:18:32.630 --> 00:18:34.420
I'm sorry, what?

00:18:34.880 --> 00:18:38.850
The courage it took to face a giant 
goddess all alone is admirable.

00:18:39.380 --> 00:18:42.680
I highly doubt I would've 
been able to do the same.

00:18:43.810 --> 00:18:45.800
I respect you.

00:18:47.100 --> 00:18:51.680
In that case, couldn't you let me 
enjoy my dinner with the good doctor?

00:18:52.040 --> 00:18:53.890
And that's exactly why...

00:18:53.890 --> 00:18:58.100
I need to watch carefully so that 
Dr. Glenn doesn't fall for you,

00:18:58.100 --> 00:19:00.100
considering how charming you are!

00:19:02.370 --> 00:19:07.120
Oh, if you're admitting defeat, 
just say so, my dear Sapphee...

00:19:10.040 --> 00:19:13.240
I have no intention of losing, Tisalia.

00:19:15.830 --> 00:19:18.510
You two seem to be getting along better now.

00:19:18.510 --> 00:19:20.750
Absolutely not!

00:19:37.500 --> 00:19:40.270
Hello, Lady Skadi. Miss Kunai.

00:19:40.610 --> 00:19:43.290
Ah, Dr. Glenn, you're here.

00:19:43.870 --> 00:19:48.530
Thank you very much for inviting us to the 
Merrow Waterways commemoration ceremony.

00:19:49.200 --> 00:19:50.730
Doctor!

00:19:51.700 --> 00:19:54.420
Lulala, and... Miss Arahnia.

00:19:54.420 --> 00:19:56.350
What are you doing here?

00:19:56.350 --> 00:19:57.800
We're having Miss Arahnia

00:19:57.800 --> 00:20:01.510
design the outfits for all the mermaids 
who will be singing at the ceremony.

00:20:01.980 --> 00:20:04.540
Maybe I need to add more frills...

00:20:04.920 --> 00:20:07.600
She's doing a final costume check right now.

00:20:07.600 --> 00:20:11.820
She's quite popular with the 
mermaids since she's so thorough.

00:20:12.100 --> 00:20:14.930
And aren't these designs cute?!

00:20:14.930 --> 00:20:17.030
Come, now! Stop movin'!

00:20:17.420 --> 00:20:18.320
Okay.

00:20:18.640 --> 00:20:25.410
Lady Draconness is quite happy that this day 
was made possible through the help of so many.

00:20:28.310 --> 00:20:34.570
She's also pleased with all of your 
work in keeping everyone healthy.

00:20:34.890 --> 00:20:37.030
I'm honored, Lady Skadi.

00:20:45.370 --> 00:20:46.880
That empty seat...

00:20:47.260 --> 00:20:49.660
That must be Lady Cthulhy's seat.

00:20:49.660 --> 00:20:51.150
Is she playing hooky again?

00:20:51.560 --> 00:20:53.880
Well, she is rather busy.

00:20:58.810 --> 00:21:03.020
And now, the Lady Draconness 
will say a few words.

00:21:03.770 --> 00:21:09.850
Ten years ago, I named this 
fortress city "Lindworm."

00:21:10.580 --> 00:21:14.310
The name refers to a dragon 
that soars the skies.

00:21:14.720 --> 00:21:21.030
There has been gossip that I gave this city 
that name because I intended to take it over.

00:21:21.760 --> 00:21:24.050
But that is absolutely false.

00:21:24.600 --> 00:21:28.470
This is a city where humans and 
monsters live side by side.

00:21:28.470 --> 00:21:30.810
Conflicts are bound to occur.

00:21:31.100 --> 00:21:34.590
But by having "dragon" in the city's name,

00:21:34.590 --> 00:21:39.070
I believed that the dragon would protect 
this city, no matter what happened.

00:21:39.710 --> 00:21:41.840
I am not talking about myself.

00:21:41.840 --> 00:21:43.800
I believed we would receive protection

00:21:43.800 --> 00:21:46.440
from my progenitor, who lives 
far above in the heavens.

00:21:47.220 --> 00:21:50.820
Therefore, I shall...

